  "slug": "receive-duplicates-and-gap",
  "title": "Duplicates of an applied seq and of a waiting seq: arrivals 1, 1, 3, 3, 2 from an empty receiver",
  "op": "receive",
  "checks": [],
  "notes": [
    "C73's pay notice deliveries arrive as seq 1, 1, 3, 3, 2 (RULINGS Q44a, G3).",
    "seq 1: the projection applies it (new id); the effects process it (1 = done + 1), done 1.",
    "seq 1 again: the projection ignores it (1 is not > 1); the effects ignore it (1 <= done).",
    "seq 3: the projection applies it (3 > 1); the effects hold it (3 > done + 1 = 2), waiting [3].",
    "seq 3 again: the projection ignores it (3 is not > 3); the effects ignore it (seq 3 is already waiting).",
    "seq 2: the projection ignores it (2 < 3); the effects process seq 2 (done 2) and then the waiting seq 3 (done 3).",
    "applied.projection is [seq 1, seq 3]; applied.effects is [seq 1, seq 2, seq 3], each once; the projection ends at seq 3 (floor 1650).",
    "seq 3 carries the same payload and version as seq 1 (C73's rollback), so a receiver that deduplicated by version instead of (id, seq) would drop it."
  ],
